WEBVTT

00:37.510 --> 00:38.960
It’s so pretty.

00:38.960 --> 00:40.240
Yeah.

01:05.180 --> 01:07.830
If I’m with you -

01:07.830 --> 01:10.620
because I’m with you -

01:10.620 --> 01:15.410
my heart is at ease.

01:16.130 --> 01:18.820
Surely, you’re the same.

01:18.820 --> 01:24.580
You’re at ease now, too.

01:24.960 --> 01:32.370
If you can just admit it,

01:33.600 --> 01:37.750
for even time to forget us,

01:38.280 --> 01:51.300
it’s only natural, at this rate.

01:52.150 --> 02:02.890
Violet drops, falling slowly from our fingertips…

02:02.890 --> 02:09.920
“Let us follow that small dream with a smile!”

02:09.920 --> 02:16.090
And just like that, we are happy

02:16.980 --> 02:21.530
over such trifling words

02:21.970 --> 02:26.700
that paint the sky.

02:44.890 --> 02:52.100
Heart of the Sea, Heart of the Sky

02:45.640 --> 02:48.180
Wait up, Marin Onee-chan!

02:48.560 --> 02:49.730
But Urin,

02:49.730 --> 02:52.480
I’m sure the person who dropped this is sad.

02:52.480 --> 02:54.270
I guess I have to go and return it.

02:54.270 --> 02:55.480
No, you can’t!

02:55.940 --> 02:58.030
The Sky is a very scary place!

02:58.030 --> 03:00.320
The people of the Sky will do horrible things to you!

03:00.320 --> 03:05.450
Didn’t the Elder of the Turtles go to the Sky a long time ago and never return?

03:07.790 --> 03:09.250
It'll be fine,

03:09.250 --> 03:12.120
because this thing is so pretty!

03:13.540 --> 03:16.050
Nothing bad will happen!

03:19.220 --> 03:21.630
Besides, I’m just going to return the ring.

03:21.630 --> 03:23.590
I’ll be back soon, okay?

03:27.720 --> 03:30.520
In the end, it’s still the same.

03:30.520 --> 03:33.270
I still ended up listening to Onee-chan.

03:39.530 --> 03:40.900
Well, I’ll be going!

03:43.240 --> 03:44.870
Hold it, Onee-chan.

03:44.870 --> 03:46.120
I’m going too.

03:47.240 --> 03:48.870
I’m just so worried!

03:48.870 --> 03:50.620
I can’t possibly stand by and not care.

03:50.870 --> 03:52.790
Urin!

03:51.500 --> 03:57.250
You’ve become reliable!

03:52.620 --> 03:57.250
How troublesome…

03:52.790 --> 03:56.250
After you return it, we’re coming back immediately!

03:56.250 --> 03:57.250
Yeah!

03:57.250 --> 03:59.590
Urin! I love you!

04:00.460 --> 04:03.380
Jeez, Onee-chan!

04:04.550 --> 04:05.510
Let’s go!

04:13.600 --> 04:14.480
Huh?

04:14.730 --> 04:16.860
Marin! Urin!

04:16.860 --> 04:17.860
Sam!

04:17.860 --> 04:19.730
We’re going to the Sky for a bit!

04:19.730 --> 04:21.360
We’ll be back soon!

04:21.360 --> 04:22.320
All right.

04:22.740 --> 04:24.780
They’re as close as ever.

04:26.120 --> 04:27.280
The Sky?

04:31.700 --> 04:34.250
Hey, Sam, have you seen Marin?

04:34.870 --> 04:36.540
Oh, if you’re looking for Marin,

04:36.540 --> 04:38.130
she just left with Urin to go to the Sky.

04:38.750 --> 04:40.000
The Sky?!

04:40.000 --> 04:41.550
Why?

04:41.960 --> 04:43.170
Who knows.

04:43.170 --> 04:45.430
She said she’d be back soon, though.

04:45.430 --> 04:46.550
It’ll be fine.

04:46.550 --> 04:49.010
In the meantime, let’s pick these together!

04:49.260 --> 04:51.520
Or would you like to go on a date with me?

04:52.600 --> 04:56.230
The Sky is filled with very strong light and darkness.

04:56.230 --> 04:59.610
Down here, there’s sea water to protect us, but in the Sky…

05:00.070 --> 05:02.070
I just hope nothing happens.

05:32.220 --> 05:33.600
It’s pretty, isn’t it?

05:33.600 --> 05:34.350
Yeah.

05:35.100 --> 05:37.020
Ring of Mercator…

05:37.020 --> 05:38.560
Want to give it a try?

05:46.150 --> 05:47.780
I can breathe!

05:54.830 --> 05:56.660
Welcome, welcome!

06:28.030 --> 06:29.110
I’m here.

06:29.360 --> 06:30.700
You’re late, Kanon!

06:30.990 --> 06:34.160
Hey, Mom, why are you wearing my school uniform?

06:34.160 --> 06:37.160
Well, isn’t everyone into the “High School Girls’ Fortune-telling” thing this year?

06:37.160 --> 06:39.830
So, maybe, if I can somehow mix myself in…

06:39.830 --> 06:40.750
You can’t do that!

06:40.870 --> 06:43.420
Well then, here comes the real thing!

06:43.420 --> 06:45.670
You’d better reel in some real income, now!

06:45.670 --> 06:47.800
I’m not even a high school student yet!

06:47.970 --> 06:49.050
What are you saying?

06:49.050 --> 06:50.430
Exams and all that stuff are just formalities, right?

06:50.510 --> 06:52.340
Even if you don’t take the entrance exams,

06:52.340 --> 06:54.260
as long as you have that evil aura,

06:54.390 --> 06:56.680
A bit of theater for realism...

06:54.850 --> 06:58.230
isn’t becoming a fraudulent fortuneteller a cinch?

06:58.230 --> 07:00.100
Don’t admit that it’s a fraud…

07:00.100 --> 07:01.060
There, there!

07:01.060 --> 07:03.060
There’s the evil aura that’s the best!

07:03.440 --> 07:05.480
Well then, I’ll go out for training.

07:05.480 --> 07:07.190
Give my regards to your boyfriend.

07:07.190 --> 07:09.070
Good luck with everything!

07:10.360 --> 07:11.240
To my boyfriend?

07:12.070 --> 07:13.490
I can’t do that.

07:14.870 --> 07:15.830
Why, you ask?

07:16.660 --> 07:19.250
That afternoon...

07:35.350 --> 07:38.060
Then she felt the trauma...

07:38.060 --> 07:39.180
Excuse me!

07:39.180 --> 07:40.480
Can you help me read my future?

07:43.900 --> 07:45.440
A couple?

07:46.020 --> 07:48.860
I guess… Forget it…

07:49.990 --> 07:51.320
A ring.

07:51.320 --> 07:53.820
Did anyone lose a ring?

07:54.030 --> 07:56.740
It’s a pretty ring!

07:56.740 --> 07:59.200
Did anyone lose it?

08:00.160 --> 08:01.410
There’s no one!

08:01.410 --> 08:02.500
Let’s go home!

08:08.420 --> 08:13.380
chida no hikari

08:08.420 --> 08:13.380
The light of Chida

08:14.390 --> 08:19.060
furisosokeba

08:14.390 --> 08:19.060
falls upon us.

08:20.470 --> 08:25.350
nakaushironizo

08:20.470 --> 08:25.350
From our backs,

08:26.270 --> 08:31.780
kageru umanu

08:26.270 --> 08:31.780
it starts to darken.

08:32.320 --> 08:37.450
hikari ni emu

08:32.320 --> 08:37.450
The light smiles.

08:38.200 --> 08:42.910
hono chiyariba

08:38.200 --> 08:42.870
The fields should be done.

08:38.870 --> 08:40.450
It’s a beautiful song.

08:41.370 --> 08:42.830
It’s an island song.

08:42.830 --> 08:46.380
It’s a song about this little island’s history.

08:46.380 --> 08:49.750
All the happy and sad moments…

08:49.750 --> 08:52.550
They’re all in the song.

08:55.590 --> 08:56.800
Hey, Urin,

08:56.800 --> 08:59.930
the Sky isn’t that scary now.

09:01.680 --> 09:04.690
Both the ring and this song are so beautiful.

09:06.770 --> 09:10.480
I wonder what the person who lost this ring is like.

09:12.070 --> 09:13.150
Let’s hurry and return the ring,

09:13.150 --> 09:14.530
and then return to the sea!

09:14.530 --> 09:15.490
Yeah!

09:16.360 --> 09:18.200
We’ll definitely find her, right?

09:27.170 --> 09:28.670
Ah, jeez…

09:28.670 --> 09:30.130
I’m so down.

09:30.130 --> 09:32.210
I feel like I’m being dragged around…

09:32.210 --> 09:34.050
I’m not recovering at all…

09:34.050 --> 09:35.470
Is anyone there?

09:35.470 --> 09:37.090
Anyone?

09:37.760 --> 09:38.760
How noisy.

09:38.760 --> 09:41.560
Whoever who dropped a ring into the sea!

09:42.390 --> 09:43.520
A ring?

09:43.520 --> 09:45.270
Give it up already.

09:45.270 --> 09:48.770
It’s adorned with this fish! It’s a pretty ring!

09:49.150 --> 09:50.150
What?

09:52.780 --> 09:53.900
It couldn’t be…

09:54.610 --> 09:55.530
Anyo-

09:56.900 --> 09:58.030
It is!

09:59.570 --> 10:02.700
What’s with this?!

10:16.670 --> 10:17.550
You dropped it.

10:19.970 --> 10:21.260
What are you doing?!

10:21.260 --> 10:23.220
No one needs this!

10:23.220 --> 10:24.140
That's why I threw it away!

10:26.100 --> 10:28.940
But it’s so pretty. Why would you want to throw it away?

10:28.940 --> 10:30.980
Because I’ve become an ungrateful character!

10:28.940 --> 10:33.270
NOTE: hito de nashi = ungrateful person; hitode nashi = no starfish.

10:33.270 --> 10:36.240
An ex-boyfriend, you know. <i>Ex</i>-boyfriend.

10:36.240 --> 10:42.160
NOTE: toto = kid’s way of saying fish; kare = curry.

10:36.780 --> 10:38.400
What’s with that cheap guy?

10:38.400 --> 10:40.780
Even though I kinda liked him for a bit…

10:42.870 --> 10:46.250
You want to throw away something you got from someone you like?

10:46.750 --> 10:47.620
What’s with you?

10:47.620 --> 10:49.790
It’s none of your business.

10:54.380 --> 10:55.550
I was rejected,

10:56.130 --> 10:58.880
so looking at this thing makes me start thinking of him,

10:58.880 --> 11:01.050
and that makes me so very upset!

11:01.840 --> 11:04.260
That’s why I should just throw it away.

11:05.510 --> 11:08.730
But, for him to give you such a pretty thing,

11:08.730 --> 11:11.690
his heart is definitely pretty as well, right?

11:29.160 --> 11:29.910
It’s fine.

11:30.460 --> 11:31.670
It’s already over.

11:50.430 --> 11:52.140
I wanna die…

11:52.690 --> 11:53.900
The ring!

11:54.520 --> 11:55.610
Onee-chan!

11:56.730 --> 11:57.320
You’re horrible.

11:59.230 --> 12:00.320
Really!

12:00.320 --> 12:03.070
Sky people really are horrible!

12:05.370 --> 12:07.950
“Sky people”?

12:10.660 --> 12:12.710
It’s here, somewhere…

12:16.170 --> 12:18.500
Where did it fly to?

12:20.340 --> 12:21.590
Onee-chan!

12:22.470 --> 12:23.470
Ah, Urin!

12:23.470 --> 12:24.550
Help me find it.

12:24.590 --> 12:25.550
Forget about it!

12:25.550 --> 12:26.890
Let’s go back!

12:28.180 --> 12:31.480
That Sky person doesn’t have a pretty heart at all,

12:31.480 --> 12:34.020
so don’t you bother to help her look for the ring!

12:36.560 --> 12:38.440
That’s not true.

12:42.820 --> 12:46.410
I really think she has a pretty heart.

12:46.410 --> 12:51.580
That’s why she can’t lose that pretty ring.

12:56.880 --> 12:59.290
Closed
Please come again next time

13:00.000 --> 13:03.590
I don’t think they’ll actually go and look for it, but…

13:14.180 --> 13:15.980
Are the fireworks starting soon?

13:15.980 --> 13:17.770
Once it gets dark, they’ll begin.

13:31.540 --> 13:34.660
But, for him to give you such a pretty thing,

13:34.660 --> 13:37.580
his heart is definitely pretty as well, right?

13:54.890 --> 13:57.770
There’s no way for us to find it.

14:05.990 --> 14:11.070
It seems that I can only spend my life listening to Onee-chan’s wishes…

14:18.750 --> 14:20.880
As I thought, we have to hurry and find it!

14:21.290 --> 14:24.960
And then, even if it’s for a second,
we have to hurry and return to the sea!

14:38.980 --> 14:40.690
Hey, what are you looking at?!

14:40.690 --> 14:42.060
Uh, nothing.

14:42.060 --> 14:43.730
I wasn’t looking at anything.

14:43.730 --> 14:45.400
You were looking!

14:46.530 --> 14:48.240
She definitely went back.

14:48.240 --> 14:49.820
That swimsuit girl.

14:50.240 --> 14:51.490
“Pretty heart” and whatnot…

14:51.490 --> 14:53.120
I don’t get her at all.

14:53.120 --> 14:56.040
Why is that girl wearing a swimsuit all over the place?

14:56.040 --> 14:57.290
How about you wear one too?

14:57.290 --> 14:58.160
Are you stupid?

14:58.540 --> 14:59.210
This way?

14:59.870 --> 15:01.000
I think…

15:01.000 --> 15:02.540
It should be…

15:02.540 --> 15:04.130
Over here.

15:04.130 --> 15:05.460
Right?

15:12.050 --> 15:14.140
There might be poisonous snakes over there.

15:15.060 --> 15:16.010
Poisonous snakes?

15:16.310 --> 15:17.470
You’ll die if you get bitten.

15:18.270 --> 15:19.980
T-Thank you!

15:20.940 --> 15:24.610
You can't possibly be looking for my ring, can you?

15:25.770 --> 15:27.110
It’ll be fine!

15:27.110 --> 15:28.570
I’ll definitely find it!

15:32.280 --> 15:33.740
You know,

15:33.740 --> 15:36.950
I did throw it into the sea.

15:36.950 --> 15:38.580
Where did you pick it up?

15:38.580 --> 15:40.080
Near my house.

15:41.410 --> 15:43.670
I saw it while I was out for a stroll.

15:43.670 --> 15:45.380
It was so pretty!

15:45.380 --> 15:46.750
It was all sheeny-shiny!

15:48.590 --> 15:49.970
I-Is that so?

15:49.550 --> 15:51.840
Is she an idiot?

15:52.840 --> 15:54.300
Nope…

15:54.300 --> 15:56.100
Not here…

16:05.610 --> 16:07.570
Or rather, it’s impossible.

16:07.570 --> 16:09.690
Finding it is absolutely impossible.

16:11.110 --> 16:13.280
I’ll go and look for Onee-chan.

16:14.780 --> 16:16.580
Let’s see…

16:20.250 --> 16:21.450
This way.

16:36.010 --> 16:39.010
That way looks easier to walk.

16:47.900 --> 16:49.610
Ah, it started.

16:49.610 --> 16:51.150
What is that?!

16:51.150 --> 16:53.400
Huh? They’re fireworks.

16:53.400 --> 16:54.820
“Fireworks”?

16:55.160 --> 16:56.200
Haven’t you seen them before?

17:17.720 --> 17:19.050
Pretty…

17:21.890 --> 17:25.690
Urin will definitely be scared…

17:25.690 --> 17:27.850
Just like that time…

17:28.730 --> 17:29.770
Wait!

17:47.170 --> 17:48.460
Ouch!

17:53.170 --> 17:54.970
Onee-chan…

18:03.810 --> 18:05.180
What’s that?

18:07.890 --> 18:09.270
No way! I found it!

18:31.000 --> 18:32.500
Urin!

18:33.170 --> 18:34.710
Urin!

18:37.470 --> 18:39.430
Urin!

18:39.970 --> 18:42.180
Urin! Where are you?

18:44.010 --> 18:46.180
Why am <i>I</i>
looking for her?

18:52.730 --> 18:54.980
Have you checked the temple in the village?

18:54.980 --> 18:56.110
Should we take a look?

18:56.480 --> 18:57.280
Yeah!

18:57.650 --> 18:58.740
Then come with me.

18:59.240 --> 18:59.900
Yeah!

19:10.210 --> 19:11.120
I did it!

19:14.040 --> 19:15.880
Now we can return to the sea!

19:17.590 --> 19:19.920
Someone is calling me?

19:23.470 --> 19:24.430
What is it?

19:25.390 --> 19:26.060
Who are you?

19:26.850 --> 19:28.020
Onee-chan?

19:34.110 --> 19:37.280
“Open it”? This box?

19:51.620 --> 19:52.870
This way.

19:54.040 --> 19:54.790
Yeah.

20:23.700 --> 20:24.360
What’s this?

21:57.460 --> 21:58.370
What?

22:10.260 --> 22:11.760
Onee-chan!

22:26.690 --> 22:31.620
Within a droplet of water,

22:32.030 --> 22:35.160
a cradle of light

22:35.500 --> 22:38.410
is trapped.

22:38.410 --> 22:43.590
And so, it colors the water.

22:44.000 --> 22:47.220
Clear your ears

22:47.220 --> 22:49.800
to eternity.

22:49.970 --> 22:55.180
Beyond a lonely dream,

22:55.180 --> 23:00.520
if one connects with another,

23:01.230 --> 23:07.110
the repeating, soft shine

23:07.530 --> 23:12.160
meets and smiles,

23:12.160 --> 23:19.330
and with just a little more, the hearts have been reached.

23:19.330 --> 23:23.920
With a transparent prayer,

23:24.130 --> 23:33.390
concealed within a gentle mouth.

23:36.060 --> 23:36.930
Did you know?

23:36.930 --> 23:38.810
Baby jellyfish don’t die.

23:38.810 --> 23:41.270
When they grow old, they become babies again.

23:41.270 --> 23:42.100
Huh?

23:42.100 --> 23:43.230
W-What’s up with that?

23:43.230 --> 23:44.940
Next time, episode 2:

23:44.940 --> 23:47.110
Heart of the Ring, Heart of the Shrine Maiden.

23:45.020 --> 23:49.940
Heart of the Ring, Heart of the Shrine Maiden

23:47.440 --> 23:49.940
I love you, everyone!
